# Retrieval Benchmark

This directory contains evaluation data for the enterprise RAG system.

## Systems

### Parent-Child
- Retrieve child chunks
- Aggregate by parent
- Rank parents
- Cross-encoder reranking

### Multi-Vector
- Retrieve generated representations
- Aggregate representations by parent
- Cross-encoder reranking

## Metrics

### Recall@1
Whether the expected parent appears at rank 1.

### Recall@3
Whether the expected parent appears in the top 3.

### MRR
Mean Reciprocal Rank.

## Target

The goal is not to maximize complexity.

The goal is to determine whether Multi-Vector Retrieval actually improves retrieval quality over Parent-Child Retrieval.
